// The rows are set up by SQL, since testDataSetupCSV creates each table from
// the store's column types, which would make the column a plain TIMESTAMP. They
// ride on the connection rather than on the test, because a test that brings
// its own `connections:` block has its connection rebuilt without the time zone
// the connection names.
